{"publicId":"02c41691-9cb4-4f8e-9420-f02458887382","title":"CRC-MYB复合物通过DNA环调控花蜜腺发育机制首次揭示","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T22:40:05.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T22:40:05.000Z","digest":"日本奈良科学技术大学Ito团队在《Nature Communications》发表研究，首次揭示DNA looping通过CRC-MYB复合物调控花蜜腺发育的分子机制。花蜜腺是花中分泌结构，此前研究认为CRC-MYB复合物参与调控但机制不明，该研究首次在花蜜腺中验证DNA looping的作用，并明确CRC-MYB复合物通过染色质环状结构调控基因表达。该成果属于植物发育分子机制的创新性发现，尚未提及后续实验验证或应用转化。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T22:56:33.968Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"DNA looping机制助力花生长出花蜜腺——Nature Communications最新研究成果","latestReport":{"id":"sg43qdf9lev60mtkoo84pkcei"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fq7XVJIn7Kqg","title":"CRC和MYB蛋白通过DNA环调控花中分泌器官的生长","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T22:40:05.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"sg43qdf9lev60mtkoo84pkcei","title":"DNA looping机制助力花生长出花蜜腺——Nature Communications最新研究成果","summary":"日本奈良科学技术大学Ito团队在《Nature Communications》发表研究，首次揭示DNA looping通过CRC-MYB复合物调控花蜜腺发育的分子机制。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T22:40:05.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"sg43qdf9lev60mtkoo84pkcei","title":"DNA looping机制助力花生长出花蜜腺——Nature Communications最新研究成果","summary":"日本奈良科学技术大学Ito团队在《Nature Communications》发表研究，首次揭示DNA looping通过CRC-MYB复合物调控花蜜腺发育的分子机制。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T22:40:05.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":9.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T01:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T02:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T04:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour